3. 1 . 5 BERT .BERT [ 3 ] is in essence a language model that consists of a set of Transformer encoders stacked on top of each other .Howeverit defines the language modeling task differently from ELMo and AWD - LSTM .A second task BERT is trained on is " next sentence prediction "
